  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Put the quark in a bowl and mix with the milk."
    },
    {
      "text": "If necessary, first peel the apple or alternatively leave it with the peel, cut it into quarters. Cut apple pieces into small slices and place in a small pan."
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat the pan and as soon as the first hiss of the apple is heard, set the heat to medium."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cinnamon and honey to the pan and mix with the apple pieces. Then heat for about 5 minutes until the apples become a little softer and the honey has melted.",
      "timerMinutes": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Put apple on the quark in the bowl and top with the muesli."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add peanut butter as the last topping on top and enjoy the meal! ☺️"
    }
  ]
